{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope Company is a Fantasy\u00a0medieval wave attack game based on combat and a evolving story. </strong>Taking inspiration from Bloon's Tower Defence 6, Mud and Blood and Battle Brothers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the game you start as a Mercenary company commander.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a range of damage dealers, immovable tanks, healers and supporters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle environments like snowy hills, castle sieges, forest blazes, monster lairs and flooded swamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to units to transform them into a blade whirlwind, a master of undeath or a titan of strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a full campaign that takes you through the story of soldiers standing against whatever evil the world brings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make meaningful choices on which missions to deploy on, who to helped first and see where your morals lay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful boss enemies that test your ability and defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the fantasy world and the forces that influence it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally against the dying of the light and be the\u00a0bulwark of humanity.</strong> Fight waves of attackers and recruit a variety of characters utilising blades, hammers and firearms alongside those with more sinister  methods of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Each Level presents a new challenge. </strong>The decisions you make can effect what threats you face and where the story will take you. Each playthrough can be played differently with to see new\u00a0routes and possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A simple and expanding game. </strong>As a solo developer the low poly art style and modular level structure means new content will be added at a steady pace will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open to feedback and suggestions. </strong>Reviews, Steam Community, Discord server and all the associated social media links are constantly used. So new features and ideas will help help shape development.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Timing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844870/f46db55021bf869ed07d65e36342f36cf584a237.jpg"},{"name":"Knight takes Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844870/499ef339ed3a7bb045478be9a74e42362